      "title": "Extract the OpenAPI parse-and-version-refusal step into a shared unit",
      "summary": "A new readOpenApiDocument unit in connector-registry holds the JSON-then-YAML parse and the OpenAPI 3.x version refusal (including a paths-shape well-formedness check), and readOpenApiOperation now delegates to it instead of holding that logic itself.",
